# OpenDome Sandbox — host env (not a mini-app)

Sandbox is a full host like OpenDomeApp. Mini-apps only need the three dock vars;
these secrets stay on Sandbox / App.

```
JWT_SECRET=
OPENDOME_SECRET=
GCP_PROJECT_ID=
GCP_CLIENT_EMAIL=
GCP_PRIVATE_KEY=
MERCHANT_PRIVATE_KEY=
MERCHANT_ADDRESS=
MERCHANT_SOLANA_ADDRESS=
CONTRACT_ADDRESS=
ADMIN_SCANNER_TOKEN=
RPC_URL=
CIRCLE_API_KEY=
CIRCLE_ENTITY_SECRET=
```

Optional: `FIRESTORE_ENV=dev|production`, `RPC_URL_*`, `MERCHANT_SOLANA_PRIVATE_KEY`
